        rule: { ru: '«How was...?» — мягкий вопрос о прошлом: how + was + кто/что.', uk: '«How was...?» — м\'яке запитання про минуле: how + was + хто/що.', es: '«How was...?» es una pregunta suave sobre el pasado: how + was + quién/qué.' , 'pt-BR': '«How was...?» é uma pergunta suave sobre o passado: como + was + quem/o quê.', vi: '«How was...?» là một câu hỏi nhẹ về quá khứ: như thế nào + was + ai/cái gì.', id: '«How was...?» adalah pertanyaan lembut tentang masa lalu: bagaimana + was + siapa/apa.', tr: '«How was...?» geçmişle ilgili yumuşak bir sorudur: nasıl + was + kim/ne.', pl: '«How was...?» to miękkie pytanie dotyczące przeszłości: jak + was + kto/co.'},
